      <item>
        <title>CFU recognition for UNIPA students</title>
        <description>

&lt;div class=&quot;article-stack&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p class=&quot;article-lead&quot;&gt;
        Participation in Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 @ Palermo may contribute to the recognition of university
        credits (CFU) for eligible University of Palermo students. Requirements depend on the
        participant&apos;s degree programme.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    
    &lt;div class=&quot;article-callout&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;cfu-status-title&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;article-callout__icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
            &lt;i class=&quot;fa-solid fa-hourglass-half&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
        &lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;h2 class=&quot;article-callout__title&quot; id=&quot;cfu-status-title&quot;&gt;Recognition details are being finalised&lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                Eligible degree programmes and their recognition requirements will be published here as soon as they are confirmed.
            &lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    

    &lt;div class=&quot;article-callout article-callout--secondary&quot; aria-labelledby=&quot;cfu-attendance-title&quot;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&quot;article-callout__icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
            &lt;i class=&quot;fa-solid fa-clipboard-check&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
        &lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;h2 class=&quot;article-callout__title&quot; id=&quot;cfu-attendance-title&quot;&gt;Attendance records&lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                Attendance in the classroom or virtual room will be recorded at both entry and exit.
            &lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    
&lt;/div&gt;
